/** Records a stored waiver: CLAIM_WAIVED sheet=<id> by=<user> person=<name> amount=<0.00> date=<yyyy-mm-dd>,
 *  then number=<n> when the claim has one; then how it moved the sheet's figures. */
public class AuditClaimWaived {
